        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Insurance Policy & Claims Management Infrastructure.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            Manage the complete insurance lifecycle — from underwriting and policy issuance through
            premium collection and claims settlement — with regulatory compliance for IPEC reporting
            built into every workflow.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
