<div class="row mb-5 align-items-center g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-kicker">Complete Policy Lifecycle</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Underwriting Through Renewal & Beyond</h2>
        <p>
            The policy administration module manages the entire lifecycle from initial proposal through
            underwriting assessment, policy issuance, endorsements, renewals, and cancellation. Rating
            engines apply tariff structures and underwriting rules consistently, while maintaining the
            flexibility for manual adjustments where risk assessment demands human judgment.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Broker and agent channels are fully integrated — commissions calculate automatically based
            on product and intermediary agreements. Premium collection tracks payments against debit
            notes with automated follow-up workflows for overdue accounts, ensuring cash flow visibility
            across the entire book of business.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-5">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=800&q=80" alt="Professional signing insurance documents" class="module-feature-img border" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
</div>

