        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Efficient Claims Settlement & IPEC Reporting</h2>
        <p>
            Claims processing follows a structured workflow from first notification of loss through
            investigation, assessment, approval, and settlement. Reserve management tracks estimated
            liabilities, and loss ratio analysis provides real-time visibility into portfolio performance
            by product line and underwriting year.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Regulatory reporting generates IPEC-compliant returns covering premium income, claims
            experience, solvency margins, and technical provisions. The system maintains the granular
            transaction data required for regulatory examination while providing management with the
            aggregated views needed for strategic decision-making.
        </p>
    </div>
